---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Breadcrumbs from "../components/Breadcrumbs.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About ArcPoint Gear | Premium Gear Intelligence"
  description="Learn about ArcPoint Gear, a premium gear intelligence publication focused on clear research, technical evaluation, and trustworthy buying guidance."
  canonical="/about"
>
  <main class="page-shell">
    <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: "About" }]} />
    <section class="page-hero" data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1>Gear intelligence for decisions that deserve better than hype.</h1>
      <p>
        ArcPoint Gear is a premium editorial publication built for readers who care about
        performance equipment, technical tradeoffs, and honest recommendation language.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section class="content-block" data-reveal>
      <h2>What We Cover</h2>
      <p>
        We focus on outdoor, athletic, tactical, photography, golf, fishing, hunting, camping, and
        performance gear. Our goal is to make complex product categories easier to evaluate without
        pretending every article is based on hands-on field testing.
      </p>
      <h2>Editorial Standard</h2>
      <p>
        When an article is a Research Review, Spec Analysis, Buying Guide, or Comparison, we label
        it clearly. Field-tested claims should only appear when the work has actually been done and
        the article is marked accordingly.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
